My temporary fix is to use `overrides` in .eslintrc (since just using an `// eslint-disable-next-line` comment did not help):
```
    overrides: [
        {
            // fix for next.js linter bug: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/28030
            files: ['**/types/nextJS.ts'],
            rules: {
                '@next/next/no-document-import-in-page': 'off',
            },
        },
    ],
```
